<title>USA: Rowe Furniture Corp Q4 shr $0.23 vs $0.11.</title>
<headline>Rowe Furniture Corp Q4 shr $0.23 vs $0.11.</headline>
<dateline>MCLEAN, Va. 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>ROWE FURNITURE CORPORATION</p>
<p>				 FOURTH QUARTER RESULTS</p>
<p>						  12/1/96	 12/3/95</p>
<p>						   12 wks	  13 wks</p>
<p> Net Shipments			  $38,082,000   $36,306,000</p>
<p> Net Income				 2,982,000     1,449,000</p>
<p>Earnings Per Share</p>
<p>  Primary					  0.23	    0.11</p>
<p> Average Shares Outstanding	  13,252,000    13,483,000</p>
<p>			     ROWE FURNITURE CORPORATION</p>
<p>				    YEAR END RESULTS</p>
<p>						52 wks		 53 wks</p>
<p> Net Shipments		    $142,723,000	 $124,939,000</p>
<p> Net Income			    7,052,000	 7,207,000(a)</p>
<p>Earnings Per Share</p>
<p>  Primary				     0.53		0.53(a)</p>
<p> Average Shares Outstanding     13,370,000	   13,607,000</p>
<p>(a)  Includes an after-tax gain of approximately $3.0 million or $0.22 per share from the sale of investment property.  Includes an after-tax charge of $265,000 or $0.02 per share for restructuring costs associated with changes in the manufacturing process. Full company name: Rowe Furniture Corp.</p>
